      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Center%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded around 1868, Center grew from a modest settlement into the county’s modest hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://centermissouri.com/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Initially spelled \"Centre,\" the town was officially platted in 1871, marking its formal establishment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Center%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A Short Line railroad reached Center in 1892, thanks to a European benefactor who funded the tracks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
