        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://centermissouri.com/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Paul Catholic Church, listed on the National Register in 1979, stands as a testament to the town’s religious heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
